  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Back the fifth wheel under a kingpin and hold ACTION to physically couple.
    Press ACTION to unhitch your own load. Deliver attached cargo to your marked
    depot and stop both real bodies for two uncontested seconds. To contest an occupied
    load, park within five meters of its kingpin and hold ACTION for three seconds
    while both rigs are slow; then physically recouple. Contact never transfers ownership.
    Trailer Thief pays a large bonus only when you actually steal and deliver another
    driver's cargo. Delivery Rush scores completed delivery count. Team Smuggling
    uses seats 1+3 against 2+4 with shared depots and shared cargo points; AI fills
    unused human seats. High-Value Cargo Hunt adds real mass and value to three load
    tiers, shown in your panel while hitched and reduced by damage. After its first
    delivery, Hard Trailer Thief AI may stake out a rival's depot instead of collecting
    more unclaimed cargo; it still must win the physical stopped contest, recouple
    and deliver to its own depot. AI difficulty changes target aggression, reaction
    delay, approach pace, backing precision and delivery pace; every difficulty uses
    the same real coupling and delivery rules. Dispatched loads return at their original
    yard positions after a delay, only when the spawn is clear.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
